{"parentUuid":"1a4392dc-ec57-43f0-afb5-8d21068d5c2e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"26ca5f8f-ff49-4828-b496-a33010a711d7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MDAFQtGB1KsCma4ywgzBmG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# **Memory**\n2\t\n3\tLast updated: \\[date\\]\n4\t\n5\t## **Active Projects**\n6\t\n7\tWhat's in flight right now. Tell Cowork \"add this to active projects\" when you kick something off, and \"archive this\" when it's done.\n8\t\n9\t* \\[Example: Redesigning the onboarding flow for new clients — started 15 Jan\\]\n10\t\n11\t## **About Me**\n12\t\n13\tKey facts about you, your business, and how you work. Say \"remember this\" during any session and Cowork will log it here. These starters show the format — swap them out with your own.\n14\t\n15\t* My business is \\[name / description\\]. We do \\[what you do\\].  \n16\t* My core tools are \\[e.g. Google Workspace, Notion, Slack — update with your actual stack\\].  \n17\t* \\[Add anything else that helps Cowork work better for you — working hours, communication preferences, pet peeves.\\]\n18\t\n19\t## **Contacts**\n20\t\n21\tPeople you work with. Cowork adds to this as names come up in conversation.\n22\t\n23\t| Name | Role / Relationship | Notes |\n24\t| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n25\t|  |  |  |\n26\t\n27\t## **Key Decisions**\n28\t\n29\tImportant calls you've made and the reasoning behind them. Cowork logs these so you've got a record when you need to revisit something later.\n30\t\n31\t* \\[Example: Chose Stripe over GoCardless for subscriptions — simpler API, better docs, worth the slightly higher fee.\\]\n32\t\n33\t"}]},"uuid":"71bec6e2-68eb-4d34-a62a-d9c305d98475","timestamp":"2026-05-21T16:14:43.565Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/Desktop/Life-OS/MEMORY.md","content":"# **Memory**\n\nLast updated: \\[date\\]\n\n## **Active Projects**\n\nWhat's in flight right now. Tell Cowork \"add this to active projects\" when you kick something off, and \"archive this\" when it's done.\n\n* \\[Example: Redesigning the onboarding flow for new clients — started 15 Jan\\]\n\n## **About Me**\n\nKey facts about you, your business, and how you work. Say \"remember this\" during any session and Cowork will log it here. These starters show the format — swap them out with your own.\n\n* My business is \\[name / description\\]. We do \\[what you do\\].  \n* My core tools are \\[e.g. Google Workspace, Notion, Slack — update with your actual stack\\].  \n* \\[Add anything else that helps Cowork work better for you — working hours, communication preferences, pet peeves.\\]\n\n## **Contacts**\n\nPeople you work with. Cowork adds to this as names come up in conversation.\n\n| Name | Role / Relationship | Notes |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n|  |  |  |\n\n## **Key Decisions**\n\nImportant calls you've made and the reasoning behind them. Cowork logs these so you've got a record when you need to revisit something later.\n\n* \\[Example: Chose Stripe over GoCardless for subscriptions — simpler API, better docs, worth the slightly higher fee.\\]\n\n","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1a4392dc-ec57-43f0-afb5-8d21068d5c2e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/Desktop/Life-OS","sessionId":"f249208d-218a-497b-b6e2-86da2a5c87b7","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
